   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Muted matte: median ~107 with lifted blacks (p1 ~16) and restrained whites (p99 ~214), olive-neutral shadows (37,36,30), neutral highlights (210,206,202), low saturation (0.22), orange 29% / red 24% / aqua 14%. Best for: Quiet fine-art portraits, painterly window light, muted outfits, editorial couple portraits with restraint, heritage interiors. Soft, desaturated, timeless.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
